            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c0e110-1111-4a11-8a11-000000000101",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 360,
        "height": 540,
        "content": "## Overview\n\nEditors and social teams: paste a public YouTube channel or video link, get the published banner and profile picture sizes.\n\nUses [YouTubeThumb.com](https://youtubethumb.com/). No API key. No login.\n\nBrowser tools:\n- [YouTube channel banner download](https://youtubethumb.com/youtube-channel-banner-download/)\n- [YouTube profile picture downloader](https://youtubethumb.com/youtube-profile-picture-downloader/)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c0e110-1111-4a11-8a11-000000000102",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        400,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 540,
        "content": "## 1. Set the YouTube URL\n\nReplace `@YouTube` with an `@handle`, a `/channel/UC…` URL, or a public watch / Shorts / youtu.be link.\n\nNo credentials are stored in this node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c0e110-1111-4a11-8a11-000000000103",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1140,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 540,
        "content": "## 2. Lookup on YouTubeThumb\n\n`GET https://youtubethumb.com/api/channel-images?url=`\n\nYour n8n host must allow outbound HTTPS to youtubethumb.com.\n\nSuccess: `ok`, `title`, `handle`, `banners[]`, `avatars[]`.\nFail: `ok: false` plus an English `error` string."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c0e110-1111-4a11-8a11-000000000104",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1680,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 540,
        "content": "## 3. Did the lookup succeed?\n\n**True** continues to the right.\n\n**False** goes **down** to Return lookup error, so later nodes never read missing arrays."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c0e110-1111-4a11-8a11-000000000107",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1680,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## Error path\n\nKeeps a clean `{ ok: false, error }` item.\n\nTypical causes: not a YouTube URL, missing channel, or YouTube served a consent page."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c0e110-1111-4a11-8a11-000000000105",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 800,
        "height": 540,
        "content": "## 4. Pick the largest public files\n\nSorts banners and avatars by pixel area (`width × height`). Outputs `largestBanner`, `largestAvatar`, and the full lists.\n\nIf the channel never uploaded header art, `bannerCount` is `0` and the download step is skipped. That is the channel, not a broken workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c0e110-1111-4a11-8a11-000000000106",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3060,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 580,
        "height": 540,
        "content": "## 5. Download the largest banner JPG\n\nRuns only when `largestBanner.url` is present.\n\n`GET https://youtubethumb.com/api/channel-image-file?url=`\n\nProxy allows only `yt3.ggpht.com` and `yt3.googleusercontent.com`.\n\nTo save the avatar instead, point this node at `largestAvatar.url`. Stop after step 4 if you only need URLs."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
